operations.profile_deletion.review.body:
Virtual machine: {vm_name}
VM ID: {vm_id}
GPU: {gpu_interface}

Delete only this VM's app profile: its saved GPU settings, authorized VM/GPU pairing and managed setup/verification history. Keep all other app profiles, the Hyper-V VM, disks, checkpoints, guest driver files and shared application artifacts.

This action does not remove GPU support, change VM power, uninstall drivers or request guest credentials. The VM must be off; GPU support may remain attached.

Delete profile confirms this review; Windows requests approval to remove the protected app records. Cancel keeps all records. The VM stays discoverable and a new reviewed setup is required to enable GPU support through this app again.
